  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_KwazelMaw</defName>
    <label>kwazel maw</label>
    <description>Kwazel Maw were giant aquatic slugs from the planet Rodia. They were a slow predatory creatures with remarkably tough hides that relied on ambush. Despite naturally inhabiting swamps, it appeared Kwazel Maw were equally comfortable on land. Their presence on other planets remains a mystery, although it is speculated that the eggs of these creatures may have been sold offworld as form of 'caviar' by unscrupulous rodian merchants.</description>
